('112.7.b.8.A',3,'A toaster gets hot when it is plugged in. Which energy change is happening?','["electrical energy to thermal energy", "thermal energy to electrical energy", "light energy to sound energy", "sound energy to chemical energy"]'::jsonb,0,'Electric current heats the wires.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.A',3,'A solar-powered calculator uses what energy to work?','["heat changed to sound", "light energy changed to electrical energy", "wind changed to chemical", "sound changed to light"]'::jsonb,1,'Solar cells change light to electricity.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.A',3,'A radio plays music. Which energy change occurs?','["light energy to heat energy", "chemical energy to magnetic energy", "electrical energy to sound energy", "sound energy to electrical energy"]'::jsonb,2,'The radio changes electrical energy to sound.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.A',3,'When a person rubs their hands together, which energy change occurs?','["sound to light", "thermal to motion", "light to motion", "motion to thermal energy"]'::jsonb,3,'Friction changes motion into heat.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.A',4,'Wind turns a turbine to light a bulb. Which order shows the energy changes?','["motion, electrical, light", "light, electrical, motion", "electrical, light, motion", "light, motion, electrical"]'::jsonb,0,'Motion turns the generator, making electricity that lights the bulb.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.B',2,'What does a circuit need to work?','["only a switch", "a complete path, an energy source, and a load", "only wires", "a magnet and a spring"]'::jsonb,1,'A working circuit needs a source, a path, and something that uses the energy.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.B',3,'Which makes a complete circuit?','["a battery and bulb with a gap in the wire", "a battery in a drawer", "a battery connected by wires to a bulb in a closed loop", "a bulb alone"]'::jsonb,2,'The loop must be unbroken.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.B',3,'A fan, a bulb, and a buzzer are connected to batteries. Which energy form does the buzzer produce?','["light", "motion", "magnetism", "sound"]'::jsonb,3,'A buzzer changes electrical energy into sound.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.B',3,'An electric motor in a circuit spins. Into which form is electrical energy changed?','["motion", "cold", "matter", "sound only"]'::jsonb,0,'A motor turns electrical energy into motion.','original'),
