('112.7.b.8.B',3,'A bulb will NOT light in a circuit. Which could be the cause?','["the bulb is too round", "the wire is too clean", "a wire is disconnected from the battery", "the room is too bright"]'::jsonb,2,'A break stops the flow of electricity.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.B',4,'A circuit has a battery, wires, and a lit bulb. The bulb gives off light and what other form?','["chemical energy only", "magnetic energy", "no other form", "thermal energy"]'::jsonb,3,'Lit bulbs also give off heat.','original'),
