('112.7.b.8.C',3,'A black shirt feels hotter than a white shirt in sunlight. Why?','["shirts make light", "dark colors reflect more light", "white absorbs more light", "dark colors absorb more light"]'::jsonb,3,'Absorbed light turns into thermal energy.','original'),
('112.7.b.8.C',3,'A shadow forms when an object blocks the path of light. Why does the shadow have the same shape as the object?','["light travels in straight lines", "shadows are made of light", "light travels in curves", "light is slow"]'::jsonb,0,'Straight-line light gives a matching shadow.','original'),
