('112.7.b.9',3,'The Sun appears to move across the sky each day. What is really happening?','["the sky is moving", "Earth is rotating", "the Sun is orbiting Earth daily", "the Moon pulls the Sun"]'::jsonb,1,'Earth''s rotation makes the Sun seem to move.','original'),
